  "question": {
    "text": "If the tangents drawn at the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> on the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math> intersect at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the orthocentre of the triangle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> is",
